<AddOnInstructionDefinition Name="F_ACT_PNEUM" Class="Standard" Revision="1.2" Vendor="rev - Francesco Tiberia - Utili Nicola" ExecutePrescan="false" ExecutePostscan="false" ExecuteEnableInFalse="false" CreatedDate="2007-11-28T13:29:27.875Z" CreatedBy="SCL0038\alessandro.grazia" EditedDate="2025-09-09T06:59:12.569Z" EditedBy="DESKTOP-I4HL37F\admin"
 SoftwareRevision="v36.00">
<RevisionNote>
<![CDATA[V1.02   : Ing.Utili Nicola
Data 	: 03.05.2021
        : Add input InhibitAlrmPneum for stop when moving finish

02/09/2020
Author: Utili
Comment: Move Aux0, Aux1 in output for use external ADDON

22/05/2019
Allineamento alla v04 presa dal base flex 131 Siemens.
25/06/2020 - Corretto errore caricamento preset timer sensor off rung 2 - Chiarini L.]]>
</RevisionNote>
