<RevisionNote>
<![CDATA[v1.7:		04.03.24
Author      :Utili
Comment: 
			Add reset bit "#iq_xRqStopImm" if true 
				"#iq_BB.Machine_SafetyCircuitOFF_ForSubModule	
				for stop category 1
			
			DI01_IMSTP is true with robotOn
			DI02_HOLD is true with "#i_xEmgStop" for
				stop category 0


v1.6:		26.09.23
Author      :Utili-Tiberia
Comment: Clear network 94=> error unlatch msg robot
Change data type Timer INT => DINT
xRbtHeadChangePos => q_xRbtHeadChangePos
xRbtMaintenancePos => q_xRbtMaintenancePos			

v1.5:		]]>
</RevisionNote>
