<AddOnInstructionDefinition Name="SpeedCalc" Class="Standard" Revision="2.0" Vendor="IMA BFB" ExecutePrescan="false" ExecutePostscan="false" ExecuteEnableInFalse="false" CreatedDate="2020-07-15T14:50:30.385Z" CreatedBy="DESKTOP-I4HL37F\admin" EditedDate="2021-09-16T11:48:00.853Z" EditedBy="DESKTOP-I4HL37F\admin"
 SoftwareRevision="v32.01">
<Description>
<![CDATA[This FB counts events occurring and time passing, and calculates instant speed 
and average speed as events/min.]]>
</Description>
<RevisionNote>
<![CDATA[v2.0        : New Release containing correct average calculation algorithm:
Modified by : M.Padovani
Last Change : 26.07.2018]]>
</RevisionNote>
