Comment: Startup from core studio5000 Cph2]]>
</Description>
<STContent>
<Line Number="0">
<![CDATA[//Calc cam point from data size and sys]]>
</Line>
<Line Number="1">
<![CDATA[EM_CaseP.rTransferPickupMotor_Cam_MagPos:=SYS.N[270] ;	]]>
</Line>
<Line Number="2">
<![CDATA[EM_CaseP.rTransferPickupMotor_Cam_OpenCasePos:=SYS.N[271]  ;	]]>
