<Text>
<![CDATA[DIV(SYS.N[397],50,T7440_rSpeedAt50Hz)DIV(SYS.N[398],30,EM_PAL.CM_RejectPlaneRollLifter.InverterIN_diWorkSpeed);]]>
</Text>
