<Rung Number="7" Type="N">
<Comment>
<![CDATA[MISSIONS DEFINITION:
1. CASE PICKUP
2.
3. PALLET A DEPOSIT
4. PALLET B DEPOSIT
5. INTERLAYER PICKUP
6. REJECT CASE CYCLE ON ROLLER CONVEYOR
7. 1st LABEL APPLICATION
