<Routine Name="CM_Lamp" Type="RLL">
<RLLContent>
<Rung Number="0" Type="N">
<Comment>
<![CDATA[STANDARD SAFE
P51 ROSSA accesa con luce continua
_Macchina ferma o in arresto per anomalia o emergenza

P52 GIALLA accesa con luce continua
_Marcia intermittente selezionata da pulsantiera fissa (volantino virtuale o Jog )
_Esclusione controlli

P52 GIALLA accesa con luce intermittente
_Macchina con ripartenza automatica

P53 VERDE accesa con luce continua
_Macchina in marcia continua
P53 VERDE accesa con luce intermittente
_Macchina in fase di arresto in seguito a comando dell’operatore da pulsantiera 
_Macchina ferma senza condizioni di allarme presenti (pronta a partire)

P54 BLU accesa con luce intermittente
_Prossima fine materiali di confezionamento
_Prossima fine del prodotto da confezionare

]]>
</Comment>
<Text>
<![CDATA[XIC(Core_HMI.PB.Rq_xFnct_LampTestEnabling)[OTL(BB.Key_LampTest) ,OTU(Core_HMI.PB.Rq_xFnct_LampTestEnabling) ,OTL(Core_HMI.PB.St_xFnct_LampTestEnabling) ];]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
<Rung Number="1" Type="N">
<Text>
<![CDATA[XIC(BB.Key_LampTest)[TON(Timers.N[8],?,?) ,XIC(Timers.N[8].DN) [OTU(BB.Key_LampTest) ,OTU(Core_HMI.PB.St_xFnct_LampTestEnabling) ] ];]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
<Rung Number="2" Type="N">
<Text>
<![CDATA[XIC(BB.Key_LampTest)OTL(MSG[22]);]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
<Rung Number="3" Type="N">
<Comment>
<![CDATA[*****************************
RED
*******************************************

Fissa
Fixed
- Macchina ferma o in arresto per anomalia o emergenza
- Test lampade
- Machine stopped or stopping because of anomaly or emergency
- Lamp test
Lampeggiante
Blinking
///]]>
</Comment>
<Text>
<![CDATA[[XIC(BB.WrngRq_MachineAlarms) ,XIC(BB.WrngRq_MachineResetAlarms) [XIC(BB.Clock_1000ms) ,XIC(UM_Config.Core.Enable_SAFE_LampsType) ] ,XIC(BB.Key_LampTest) ]OTE(OUT.P0500_01_RD);]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
<Rung Number="4" Type="N">
<Comment>
<![CDATA[RESET LAMP]]>
</Comment>
<Text>
<![CDATA[[XIO(BB.WrngRq_MachineAlarms) [XIC(BB.WrngRq_MachineResetAlarms) [XIO(UM_Config.Core.Enable_SAFE_LampsType) XIC(BB.Clock_1000ms) ,XIC(UM_Config.Core.Enable_SAFE_LampsType) XIC(BB.Clock_500ms) ] ,XIO(BB.WrngRq_MachineResetAlarms) ] ,XIC(BB.Key_LampTest) ]OTE(OUT.P1100_04);]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
<Rung Number="5" Type="N">
<Comment>
<![CDATA[*********************************
GREEN
*****************************************
Fissa
Fixed
- Macchina con ciclo automatico ed in movimento.
- Test lampade
- Machine with automatic cycle active and is moving.
- Lamp test
Lampeggiante Blinking
0.25 sec ON
0.25 sec OFF
- Macchina in fase di arresto in seguito a comando dell’operatore da pulsantiera 
- Macchina senza allarmi presenti e pronta ad essere avviata dall’operatore (avvio 
marcia automatica).
- Machine stopping for operator’s request
- Machine without alarms present and ready to be started by the operator 
(automatic cycle start).]]>
</Comment>
<Text>
<![CDATA[[XIC(BB.WrngRq_MachineReadyForAuto) XIO(BB.WrngRq_MachineAutoCycle) [XIO(UM_Config.Core.Enable_SAFE_LampsType) XIC(BB.Clock_1000ms) ,XIC(UM_Config.Core.Enable_SAFE_LampsType) XIC(BB.Clock_500ms) ] ,XIC(BB.WrngRq_MachineAutoCycle) XIC(BB.WrngRq_MachineRunning) ,XIC(BB.Key_LampTest) ]OTE(OUT.P0500_01_GN);]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
<Rung Number="6" Type="N">
<Text>
<![CDATA[XIC(BB.WrngRq_MachineReadyForAuto)[OTE(OM_Interface.xHmi_WrngRq_MachineReadyForAuto) ,OTU(BB.WrngRq_MachineReadyForAuto) ];]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
<Rung Number="7" Type="N">
<Comment>
<![CDATA[************************************************
ORANGE
********************************************
Fissa Fixed
- Marcia intermittente selezionata da pulsantiera fissa (jog attivo)
- Connettore inserito pulsantiera mobile (jog attivo)
- Volantino manuale inserito
- Controlli fine materiali esclusi da operatore
- Arresti per errori consecutivi esclusi da operatore
- Esclusione temporanea di controlli attuabile da pulsantiera
- Test lampade
- Jog mode active
- Mobile keyboard (for jog) connected
- Manual handwheel inserted
- Check for materials depletion disabled by operator
- Consecutive errors alarm disabled by operator
- Generic check disabled by operator
- Lamp test

Lampeggiante Blinking
0.25 sec ON
0.25 sec OFF
- Macchina con ciclo automatico attivo ma senza consenso da valle (o senza 
consenso da monte, se presente), o senza carico minimo. Il lampeggio è prioritario 
sulla luce fissa (casi precedenti).
- Machine with automatic cycle active without downstream consent (or without 
consent from upstream, it the signal is present), or without minimum load. 
Blinking has priority over the case of fixed light (previous cases)]]>
</Comment>
<Text>
<![CDATA[[XIC(BB.WrngRq_MachineAutoCycle) XIO(BB.WrngRq_MachineRunning) [XIO(UM_Config.Core.Enable_SAFE_LampsType) XIC(BB.Clock_1000ms) ,XIC(UM_Config.Core.Enable_SAFE_LampsType) XIC(BB.Clock_500ms) ] ,XIC(UM_Config.Core.Enable_SAFE_LampsType) XIC(BB.Safe_RqFixedOrangeLamp) XIO(BB.Automatic_CycleActive) ,XIC(BB.Key_LampTest) ]OTE(OUT.P0500_01_OG);]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
<Rung Number="8" Type="N">
<Text>
<![CDATA[XIC(BB.WrngRq_MachineRunning)[OTE(OM_Interface.xHmi_WrngRq_MachineRunning) ,OTU(BB.WrngRq_MachineRunning) ];]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
<Rung Number="9" Type="N">
<Comment>
<![CDATA[***************************
BLUE
*******************************
Fissa
Fixed
- Test lampade
- Lamp test
Lampeggiante Blinking
0.25 sec ON
0.25 sec OFF
- Materiali di consumo in esaurimento.
- Consumable materials exhaustion]]>
</Comment>
<Text>
<![CDATA[[XIC(BB.WrngRq_PackingMatOutCondition) [XIO(UM_Config.Core.Enable_SAFE_LampsType) XIC(BB.Clock_1000ms) ,XIC(UM_Config.Core.Enable_SAFE_LampsType) XIC(BB.Clock_500ms) ] ,XIC(BB.Key_LampTest) ]OTE(OUT.P0500_01_BU);]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
<Rung Number="10" Type="N">
<Comment>
<![CDATA[***************************************
BUZZER MANAGEMENT
***************************************
Fissa per 10 sec, spenta 
per 50 sec, mentre la 
causa è attiva
No tacitazione da HMI
Fixed for 10 sec, off for 
50 sec, while cause is 
active
No silencing from HMI
- Materiali di consumo in esaurimento.
- Prodotti da rimuovere (pallet completo, massimo carico scarto, ecc)
- Consumable materials exhaustion.
- Products to be removed (pallet complete, discarded products maximum load, etc)
Lampeggiante
Blinking
0.5 sec ON
0.5 sec OFF
- Preavviso dell’imminente avvio del ciclo automatico della macchina alla 
pressione del pulsante di marcia
- Test lampade
- Warning to the imminent start of the automatic cycle of the machine when the 
auto push-button is pressed
- Lamp tes]]>
</Comment>
<Text>
<![CDATA[TimeSquareWaveGenerator(TimeIF_WarningHorn,10000,50000);]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
<Rung Number="11" Type="N">
<Text>
<![CDATA[XIC(Core_HMI.PB.Rq_xSirenMuting)XIO(Core_HMI.PB.St_xOpenAlarmPg)[OTL(MSG[12]) ,OTU(Core_HMI.PB.Rq_xSirenMuting) ];]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
<Rung Number="12" Type="N">
