<Text>
<![CDATA[XIC(BB.Machine_Enable)XIO(BB.SetSize)[XIO(BB.SizeChange_InProgress) OTL(MSG[7]) ,OTL(BB.Movement_InhibitionRq) ];]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
<Rung Number="23" Type="N">
<Comment>
<![CDATA[MSG[17] Remove product and reset counter]]>
</Comment>
<Text>
<![CDATA[XIC(BB.Count_EnableCheckOfResetCounts)XIC(BB.Count_GrtZero)[OTL(MSG[17]) ,OTL(BB.Movement_InhibitionRq) ];]]>
