</Text>
</Rung>
<Rung Number="3" Type="N">
<Comment>
<![CDATA[*****************************
RED
*******************************************

Fissa
Fixed
- Macchina ferma o in arresto per anomalia o emergenza
- Test lampade
- Machine stopped or stopping because of anomaly or emergency
- Lamp test
Lampeggiante
Blinking
///]]>
</Comment>
<Text>
<![CDATA[[XIC(BB_CRS.WrngRq_MachineReadyForAuto) XIO(BB_CRS.WrngRq_MachineAutoCycle) ,XIO(BB_CRS.WrngRq_MachineAutoCycle) XIC(BB_CRS.WrngRq_MachineAlarms) XIC(BB_CRS.Clock_500ms) ,XIO(BB_CRS.WrngRq_MachineAutoCycle) XIO(BB_CRS.WrngRq_MachineAlarms) ,XIC(BB_CRS.Key_LampTest) ]OTE(OUT_CRS.P9480_01_4_RD);]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
<Rung Number="4" Type="N">
